---
title: "claim (Sui Framework: package)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_otw: assert is_one_time_witness(otw)
    q_check_otw --> q_abort: not OTW
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ENotOneTimeWitness
    q_check_otw --> q_get_type: valid OTW
    q_get_type --> q_create: type_name = type_name::with_original_ids(OTW)
    q_create --> [*]: return Publisher(id, package, module_name)

    note right of q_check_otw
        INV-001: only one Publisher per module (OTW constraint)
        INV-002: Publisher proves package/module origin
        INV-003: Publisher enables creating TransferPolicy, Display, etc.
    end note
